// PSS v3.0 LRM — Example 264: Explicit specification of the implementation language (page 350)
package known_c_functions {
import C function generic_functions::compute_expected_value;
}

22.4.2.1 Syntax
Syntax 87—Import class declaration
The following also apply:
a)
Imported class functions support the same return and parameter types as imported functions. import
class declarations also support capturing the class hierarchy of the foreign language classes.
b)
Fields of import class type can be instantiated in package and component scopes. An import class
field in a package scope is a global instance. A unique instance of an import class field in a compo-
nent exists for each component instance.
c)
